# Conforming fixture: a slot whose slotForm points at a form resource, not a literal (lang:SlotFormStructuralShape).

@prefix lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:english a lang:SignSystem .
ex:slot a lang:FormSlot ; lang:slotIndex 0 ; lang:slotForm ex:w0 .
ex:w0 a lang:Form ; lang:inSignSystem ex:english .
